    voiceSection: { heading: 'Your legal knowledge. Your way of explaining it.', paragraphs: ['Some lawyers communicate with direct, practical language. Others bring a more analytical or conversational style. Your content should reflect how you naturally explain your work.','Interviews, existing writing, and feedback establish a voice guide covering tone, vocabulary, key messages, and expressions to avoid. A custom GPT can be configured with approved material and that guidance to support article drafts, post ideas, and video scripts.'], items: ['Brand-voice guide.','Approved messaging examples.','Recurring content themes.','Custom GPT configuration where selected.','Sample drafts and refinement.'], closing: 'Drafting assistance supports your voice. Your judgement and review shape the final message.' },
